+## Request 17: VAT Report (Completed)
+- Added `vatSummary(invoices)` function to src/reports.js:
+  - Returns VAT summary across invoices
+  - Returns array directly (not ok/fail pattern)
+  - Filters invoices by status: 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'
+  - Groups lines by VAT rate
+  - For each rate calculates:
+    - base = lineTotal - lineDiscount (amount after discount)
+    - vat = lineVAT (VAT calculated at that rate)
+  - Returns array with entries: { rate, base, vat }
+  - Sorted by rate descending (high to low)
+  - Accumulates across multiple lines and invoices with same rate
+- Added 11 new VAT report tests covering:
+  - Empty and draft invoice filtering
+  - Grouping by VAT rate
+  - Base calculation with discounts
+  - Multiple VAT rates in single report
+  - Sorting by rate descending
+  - Accumulation of multiple lines/invoices
+  - Partially paid and paid invoices
+  - Multiple lines with different rates in one invoice
+- All 206 tests pass (195 existing + 11 new VAT report tests)
+
 ## Constraints Followed
 - Money stored as integer cents
 - Never throw; use fail() for errors
